| Đại | (chỉ màn hình) `RuntimeError: mat1 and mat2 shapes cannot be multiplied (3x4 and 5x2)` です。<br>*(`RuntimeError: mat1 and mat2 shapes cannot be multiplied (3x4 and 5x2)`)* |
